<meta name="description" content="The ISE is an inclusive and innovative Dutch International School, providing High-Quality Education in the Eindhoven region. ISE’s curriculum is designed to foster independent learners, global mindsets, and world citizens who continue to develop curiosity in learning so that they have the strategies to be able to become lifelong learners!" />
